  </ActionButton>
  
  <Markdown id="interdisciplinary_3_intro">
In this module, you'll apply what you've learned in class about the interdisciplinary research process and the Broad Model of the Interdisciplinary Research Process. The module contains everything you need to complete the project.

There are instructions on the screen to help you navigate and give your answers. Please follow them carefully.

The purpose of this task is to help you practice **doing** the interdisciplinary research process **yourself**. Therefore, please **do not use an AI tool like ChatGPT, Copilot, Grok, or Claude to answer these questions**. Also, please compose your answers by yourself **directly in this interface**. Please don't write your answers elsewhere and paste them into this window. It's safe to write in the interface; your work is saved as you type.

Remember that I will be seeing these results, so please take it seriously and do your best work. I think you'll enjoy it.

Please keep in mind that this is a learning opportunity, not a test. You will often be given a chance to answer a question, and then review the correct answer on a following screen. You are allowed to revise your answers, but be aware that the system will record both your **initial** answers and your **revisions**, and your revision history will be available to me for review.
  </Markdown>
  
